1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,940
P3. Schools wait days for answers about workshops.

2
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:05,473
Back to the public portal, on a phone.

3
00:00:05,553 --> 00:00:14,073
A school counselor requests a safety workshop in Spanish.

4
00:00:14,153 --> 00:00:16,907
She sends it. She does not need an account.

5
00:00:16,987 --> 00:00:18,507
Back in Roomcord, in the Workshop requests room.

6
00:00:18,587 --> 00:00:22,007
The request arrives in the Workshop requests room.

7
00:00:22,087 --> 00:00:27,507
The agent asks every missing question in one reply and opens request W002.

8
00:00:27,587 --> 00:00:30,040
Later, the school uses the portal again.

9
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:38,073
Later, the school approves slides version 2 on the portal.

10
00:00:38,153 --> 00:00:39,673
Back in Roomcord.

11
00:00:39,753 --> 00:00:42,673
The approval arrives in the room.

12
00:00:42,753 --> 00:00:46,933
The tracker records school approved v2, and who approved it.

